From 6869924c2fee57647e2e0bcf88db211d2c097ecc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 06:22:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(tui): persist failed-build model picks before retry
 [daveey]

Agent-less picks updated only memory, so the next allocation had no committed authority to replace an exact pin. Record the canonical ordered intent under the stored session key before publishing the override, serialized with build admission. Existing canonical mutation coverage did not cross the legacy failed-build setter. Add composed allocator and ordering/refusal regressions plus bounded chained build diagnostics.
